  "description": "Secretary Yeon-woo flees to her hometown of Moksan County, facing the harassment of Vice President Yoon-seok. There, she meets Seong-heon, the executive director of Seolyang Construction. Seong-heon's once icy heart melts and seeps into Yeon-woo, who resembles the warmth of spring. Meanwhile, Yoon-seok sets out to find Yeon-woo...\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
